    {
      "id": "claim_22d82f7aa254463c9ef178c846c2080f",
      "statement": "RSA public keys are exchanged through the shared artifacts: the offer peer's base64 SPKI public key is the 'p' query param of the offer link (embedded by createSDPLink from the once-minted keypair), and the answer peer's base64 SPKI public key is appended after '|' in the answer code (empty when downgraded); the receive page derives isEncrypt from the presence of 'p' (as reactive state that the validated import can downgrade to false) so the encryption mode propagates from the offer side.",
